data: {"id": "6e89c97a80784efa-thinking-parallel_evidence-1773", "run_id": "6e89c97a80784efa", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据 kubectl 工具的结果，以下是初步事实、冲突和缺口分析：\n\n### 已采集事实\n1.  **异常状态确认**：Pod `workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` 处于 `Error` 状态 (READY 0/1)，`containerStatuses` 显示容器 `app` 处于 `ready=False` 且 `reason=Error, exitCode=2` 状态。\n2.  **持续重启**：容器 `app` 已经重启了 4 次 (最后一次在 64秒前)，且 kubelet 发出了 `Warning: BackOff` 事件 (最近 116秒内发生 8次)。这证实了 Pod 陷入了 CrashLoopBackOff 的重启循环中。\n3.  **运行环境**：Pod 调度在 `node2`，使用镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令为 `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`。\n\n### 候选原因分析\n-   **支持**：Exit code 2 和持续的 Bac", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788436628768, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "6e89c97a80784efa-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "6e89c97a80784efa", "seq": 1774, "ts_ms": 1788436635844, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 67.01, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-06", "name": "workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/6e89c97a80784efa-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "3b581293f0a2fbd076824ba8f978832d1ed96d2575720eff8779da49c56e1d02", "bytes": 2450}, "snapshot_sha256": "d7e990e75931858092af1b00258dbf0352c63c2373b3fd13810f520c5aabad61"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

